      "created_at": "2014-01-12T07:08:16.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Glad you enjoyed your first game! &nbsp;The other villains in the base game are unique and fun/difficult in their own right. &nbsp;Shattered Timelines has some crazy villains that will make your head spin!</p><p>Be prepared to become addicted; pretty soon, you'll have picked up Rook City + Infernal Relics as well as the Unity, The Scholar, Ambuscade, Miss Information, Silver Gulch, and Final Wasteland mini-expansions. &nbsp;Hope your wallet is ready for it!</p>",
